Portions adapted from meyaomiao/deepclub-desktop, commit b9719c4,
package @deepclub/dsh-media-tools (declared MIT), specifically
src/media-client.ts and src/output.ts. DeepClub mobile changes replace the
desktop catalog/configuration with device authorization, require per-operation
approval, and bind background tasks to their current session and credentials.
No desktop UI, Whaleness gateway, or gateway dependency is included here.

